                    "href": "s3://cgep-lab-grc-evidence-vault-e53e936e/runs/33811511395/evidence-33811511395-7095d18037b3416df045802ce72e58f1bfccbd08.tar.gz",
                    "text": "Signed pipeline bundle containing terraform plan.json."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "uuid": "f6f7bf2e-9a82-46e2-8ea7-2f248267ad9f",
                "control-id": "au-3",
                "description": "Access logging is enforced via aws_s3_bucket_logging, writing to a dedicated access-log bucket so every request against the primary bucket is recorded.",
                "props": [
                  { "name": "implementation-status", "value": "implemented" },
                  { "name": "terraform-resource", "value": "aws_s3_bucket_logging.primary" }
